 492:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_color.h ****  * @param mix The ratio of the colors. 0: full `c1`, 255: full `c2`, 127: half `c1` and half `c2`.
 493:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/misc/lv_color.h ****  *            Should be modified like mix = `255 - mix`
